{"id": "FT-PO-E3", "version": 1, "type": "evidence", "tier": "candidate", "evidence_kind": "behavioral_observation", "text": "Actual HTML/PDF/Impress-PPTX reviewed at1280/390 with full-size samples and contact sheets; spec006 gallery records fixes/open items. Films1280height60186before→16861default/45082all-columns-open; college75832→8669default. Both summary decks12slides; films full61. Fractional count ticks, redundant numeric rarity notes, legacy months and full-deck box ticks fixed on repeat capture. Fixed exports need phone zoom; comprehensive views remain long.", "method": "Offline Chromium screenshots, actual LibreOffice conversion/PyMuPDF rasterization, existing public typography/chart guidance and published YData report comparison.", "limits": "Builder representative visual inspection, not every pixel or independent acceptance; screenshot bytes depend on renderer/fonts.", "relations": [{"rel": "supports", "to": "FT-PO-C1@1"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:src.fathom.renderers.dictionary_and_provenance_html"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:src.fathom.exports.pdf_bytes"}, {"rel": "observed_on", "to": "code:src.fathom.exports.pptx_bytes"}]}
